<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS SELLS 26.6 PCT STAKE IN GRUNDIG.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS SELLS 26.6 PCT STAKE IN GRUNDIG.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Friday it had sold a 26.6 percent stake in Grundig, leaving it with a five percent holding.</p>
</text>
